=\"u175f761a\" id=\"u175f761a\">继承</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u719a42b3\" id=\"u719a42b3\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1684835177145-5d8d0d61-8c21-4ac4-9d08-ff213cb87e77.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u1eae5020-67d3-468f-9777-3085ca1060f%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue22aa816-85ad-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A443%2C%22originHeight%22%3A240%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f8f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uda0a34e3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u58220dd9\" id=\"u58220dd9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2eaee4f6\" id=\"u2eaee4f6\">中国人、美国人、非洲人都是属于Human人类的子类</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u94f9752e\" id=\"u94f9752e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u80c2d43f\" id=\"u80c2d43f\">对于Human来说有多个子类就称为多态</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%E5%A4%9A%E6%80%81%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%5Cn%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%23%20%E7%88%B6%E7%B1%BB%5Cnclass%20Human%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20eat(self)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20print('%E4%BA%BA%E7%B1%BB%E5%90%83%E9%A5%AD')%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%5Cnclass%20ZhHuman(Human)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20eat(self)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20print('%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%AD%B7%E5%AD%90%E5%90%83%E9%A5%AD')%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%5Cnclass%20UsHuman(Human)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20eat(self)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20print('%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%88%80%E5%8F%89%E5%90%83%E9%A5%AD')%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E9%9D%9E%E6%B4%B2%E4%BA%BA%5Cnclass%20AfricaHuman(Human)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20eat(self)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20print('%E9%9D%9E%E6%B4%B2%E4%BA%BA%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E7%94%A8%E6%89%8B%E5%90%83%E6%81%A9%E5%B8%8C%E7%8E%9B')%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cndef%20someone_eat(someone)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20'''%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%B7%E5%A4%87%E5%90%83eat%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%5Cn%20%20%20%20'''%5Cn%20%20%20%20someone.eat()%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%AA%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%5Cnhuman%20%3D%20Human()%5Cnzh_human%20%3D%20ZhHuman()%5Cnus_human%20%3D%20UsHuman()%5Cnafrica_huamn%20%3D%20AfricaHuman()%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8translate%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%5Cnsomeone_eat(human)%5Cnsomeone_eat(zh_human)%5Cnsomeone_eat(us_human)%5Cnsomeone_eat(africa_huamn)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JwpGo%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u1a229944\" id=\"u1a229944\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7a8a6949\" id=\"u7a8a6949\">someone_eat方法需要接收具备</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc46f13b7\" id=\"uc46f13b7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3431d5f5\" id=\"u3431d5f5\">eat</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u33964741\" id=\"u33964741\">功能的对象,但是由于</span><code data-lake-id=\"u596b7be3\" id=\"u596b7be3\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc65f98ec\" id=\"uc65f98ec\">ZhHuman</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubfe9894d\" id=\"ubfe9894d\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u15205bb8\" id=\"u15205bb8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue0204d69\" id=\"ue0204d69\">USHuman</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uddb6e778\" id=\"uddb6e778\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u2f8701d1\" id=\"u2f8701d1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0ca57731\" id=\"u0ca57731\">AfricaHuman</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2541a20c\" id=\"u2541a20c\">都具备</span><code data-lake-id=\"u3a1816c8\" id=\"u3a1816c8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud324f3e1\" id=\"ud324f3e1\">eat</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0df25fe9\" id=\"u0df25fe9\">功能（继承了Human）。所以也可以传递到</span><code data-lake-id=\"uecf31ed9\" id=\"uecf31ed9\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaa9ee0ee\" id=\"uaa9ee0ee\">someone_eat</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubbd7072f\" id=\"ubbd7072f\">方法中</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud9f666e3\" id=\"ud9f666e3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36eccf03\" id=\"u36eccf03\">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"kZkm9\" id=\"kZkm9\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2410f3fe\" id=\"u2410f3fe\">扩展知识</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"AYzJv\" id=\"AYzJv\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7f973569\" id=\"u7f973569\">鸭子类型</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u79923f80\" id=\"u79923f80\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8dd3d710\" id=\"u8dd3d710\">一只鸟走起来像鸭子、游泳起来像鸭子、叫起来也像鸭子，那么这只鸟可以被称为鸭子。这就是鸭子类型</span><code data-lake-id=\"uec576b87\" id=\"uec576b87\"><span data-lake-id=\"u76c8b109\" id=\"u76c8b109\">Duck Typing</span></code></p><p data-lake-id=\"u27b8b7c6\" id=\"u27b8b7c6\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf2d77cef\" id=\"uf2d77cef\">对于上述多态中的的</span><code data-lake-id=\"ubabd416f\" id=\"ubabd416f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u549a8707\" id=\"u549a8707\">someone_eat</span></code></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22class%20Dog%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20eat(self)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20print('%E7%8B%97%E5%90%83%E9%AA%A8%E5%A4%B4')%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cndef%20someone_eat(someone)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20'''%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%B7%E5%A4%87%E5%90%83eat%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%5Cn%20%20%20%20'''%5Cn%20%20%20%20someone.eat()%5Cn%5Cndog%20%3D%20Dog()%5Cnsomeone_eat(dog)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Jzw4p%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u786725bb\" id=\"u786725bb\"><code data-lake-id=\"u52761fdb\" id=\"u52761fdb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1d3c1144\" id=\"u1d3c1144\">someone_eat</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u30d012e4\" id=\"u30d012e4\">需要传递一个具备</span><code data-lake-id=\"u962d6bb8\" id=\"u962d6bb8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36db106c\" id=\"u36db106c\">eat</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u849d9c2a\" id=\"u849d9c2a\">方法的对象，但是</span><code data-lake-id=\"uec712ed4\" id=\"uec712ed4\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaddbeb5e\" id=\"uaddbeb5e\">Dog</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uee6c0d23\" id=\"uee6c0d23\">也具备</span><code data-lake-id=\"u122318cc\" id=\"u122318cc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4b353fe6\" id=\"u4b353fe6\">eat</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u15fbe0be\" id=\"u15fbe0be\">功能,所以也可以传递运行</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2bd2aded\" id=\"u2bd2aded\"><span data-lake-id=\"uedee9e89\" id=\"uedee9e89\">这是由于python是动态类型语言，不能像C++、Java等静态类型语言一样，限制传递的数据类型</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub12f82ad\" id=\"ub12f82ad\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue6c20a92\" id=\"ue6c20a92\">只要运行时发现dog对象有这个功能，就可以在函数中使用</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"UJ4d1\" id=\"UJ4d1\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1cc871d0\" id=\"u1cc871d0\">多继承</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u2df6b5ce\" id=\"u2df6b5ce\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf9a69504\" id=\"uf9a69504\">当一个类从多个父类继承属性和方法时，就称为多继承。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufc505cf6\" id=\"ufc505cf6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucbbc5e15\" id=\"ucbbc5e15\">多继承格式:<br /></span><code data-lake-id=\"u1e0ec515\" id=\"u1e0ec515\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9fba4d9\" id=\"ud9fba4d9\">class 子类(父类1,父类2...)</span></code></p><p data-lake-id=\"u866028c2\" id=\"u866028c2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1a5d38c1\" id=\"u1a5d38c1\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0261e5c9\" id=\"u0261e5c9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud49f9fdf\" id=\"ud49f9fdf\">下面是一个使用多继承的示例案例，展示了一个动物类和一个能飞的特性类和游泳的特性类：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22class%20Animal%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__init__(self%2C%20name)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.name%20%3D%20name%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20eat(self)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20print(f%5C%22%7Bself.name%7D%20is%20eating.%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20sleep(self)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20print(f%5C%22%7Bself.name%7D%20is%20sleeping.%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnclass%20Flyable%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20fly(self)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20print(f%5C%22%7Bself.name%7D%20is%20flying.%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnclass%20Swimmable%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20swim(self)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20print(f%5C%22%7Bself.name%7D%20is%20swimming.%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnclass%20Duck(Animal%2C%20Flyable%2C%20Swimmable)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__init__(self%2C%20name)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20super().__init__(name)%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnduck%20%3D%20Duck(%5C%22Donald%5C%22)%5Cnduck.eat()%20%20%20%23%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%3A%20Donald%20is%20eating.%5Cnduck.sleep()%20%20%20%23%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%3A%20Donald%20is%20sleeping.%5Cnduck.fly()%20%20%20%23%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%3A%20Donald%20is%20flying.%5Cnduck.swim()%20%20%20%23%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%3A%20Donald%20is%20swimming.%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22B1ztx%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ufd24ce23\" id=\"ufd24ce23\"><span data-lake-id=\"u23512648\" id=\"u23512648\">在上面的示例中，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u73d2f8eb\" id=\"u73d2f8eb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucac79c02\" id=\"ucac79c02\">Animal</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1c26d773\" id=\"u1c26d773\">是基类，</span><code data-lake-id=\"ufb88b993\" id=\"ufb88b993\"><span data-lake-id=\"u01c8c551\" id=\"u01c8c551\">Flyable</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua3a4f983\" id=\"ua3a4f983\">和</span><code data-lake-id=\"u2163a98e\" id=\"u2163a98e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u99565bf8\" id=\"u99565bf8\">Swimmable</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u393d4537\" id=\"u393d4537\">是特性类。</span><code data-lake-id=\"u03db61d8\" id=\"u03db61d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0999aeaf\" id=\"u0999aeaf\">Duck</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub82c8058\" id=\"ub82c8058\">类通过多继承从这些类继承了属性和方法。通过调用这些继承的方法，我们可以看到</span><code data-lake-id=\"ud26f0e12\" id=\"ud26f0e12\"><span data-lake-id=\"uedcc0781\" id=\"uedcc0781\">Duck</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubfebb4c7\" id=\"ubfebb4c7\">对象具有吃、睡、飞和游泳的行为。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u457c7396\" id=\"u457c7396\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud0dfd7a8\" id=\"ud0dfd7a8\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1dd52823\" id=\"u1dd52823\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubf72fb4f\" id=\"ubf72fb4f\">注意，在多继承的情况下，当多个父类中具有相同名称的方法时，解释器将按照方法解析顺序（Method Resolution Order，MRO）来确定使用哪个方法。在上述示例中，Python的默认MRO算法会按照类定义时的顺序来解析方法。在这个例子中，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u163a9945\" id=\"u163a9945\"><span data-lake-id=\"u447845b6\" id=\"u447845b6\">Duck</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua3952f2a\" id=\"ua3952f2a\">类首先从</span><code data-lake-id=\"u22ac0d05\" id=\"u22ac0d05\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub5bfb77c\" id=\"ub5bfb77c\">Animal</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8661db25\" id=\"u8661db25\">类继承方法，然后是</span><code data-lake-id=\"ud922d370\" id=\"ud922d370\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub32bd4af\" id=\"ub32bd4af\">Flyable</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub60ca449\" id=\"ub60ca449\">类，最后是</span><code data-lake-id=\"u3d82fb6d\" id=\"u3d82fb6d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3ff2f623\" id=\"u3ff2f623\">Swimmable</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u39697849\" id=\"u39697849\">类。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"nFCgO\" id=\"nFCgO\"><br></h3>",
